1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
We’re capping our beta at two hundred people, and the reason isn’t marketing. It’s calendars.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:11,000
Every founding seat comes with a one-on-one call where we tear down your content together. Thirty minutes each. Two hundred of those is the honest limit of humans we have.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:19,000
No countdown timer. No “only three left” that resets at midnight. Seats fill in waitlist order, and when they’re gone the page will just say so.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:28,000
First year of Pro for a hundred and ninety dollars, the call included, refund rules printed on the page. If that’s useful, the waitlist is in my bio. If not — the free teardowns continue either way.

